### =========================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN ADMINISTRADOR - ADMIN LOGIN
### =========================================

### PEGA AQUI EL TOKEN DEVUELTO POR EL LOGIN:
@adminToken =
### 0. Login administrador

POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@smartqr.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### =========================================
###     GENERACIÓN QR - ADMIN
### =========================================
### Generar y guardar QR para la Mesa 5

POST http://localhost:8080/qr/table/5
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =========================================
###         PRUEBAS DE PRODUCTOS
### =========================================

### 1. [ADMIN] Ver todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. [ADMIN] Crear un producto nuevo
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Montadito de Jamón",
  "description": "Jamón ibérico con aceite",
  "price": 2.50,
  "category": "MONTADITO",
  "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/jamon.png"
}

### 3. [ADMIN] Ver productos sin stock
GET http://localhost:8080/products/out-of-stock
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =========================================
###         DASHBOARD DE METRICAS - ADMIN
### =========================================

### 4. [ADMIN] Consultar metricas generales del dashboard

GET http://localhost:8080/dashboard/metrics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================================
###         GRAFICOS PNG - ADMIN
### =========================================

### 5. [ADMIN] Generar grafico de ingresos por metodo de pago
### El endpoint devuelve la imagen PNG y tambien la guarda localmente en:
### requests/charts/income-by-payment-method.png

GET http://localhost:8080/dashboard/charts/income-by-payment-method
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 6. [ADMIN] Generar grafico de productos vendidos
### El endpoint devuelve la imagen PNG y tambien la guarda localmente en:
### requests/charts/product-sales.png

GET http://localhost:8080/dashboard/charts/product-sales
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
### =========================================
###         FEEDBACK ANALYTICS - ADMIN
### =========================================

### 7. [ADMIN] Consultar estadisticas de feedback analizado por IA OPENAI

GET http://localhost:8080/feedback/statistics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =========================================
###         AGENTE LOCAL OLLAMA - ADMIN
### =========================================
### IMPORTANTE:
### - Ollama debe estar ejecutandose en local.
### - Modelo usado: qwen3:4b.
### - Para obtener metricas con ventas, ejecutar antes un pago completado
###   desde CUSTOMER_REQUESTS.http.
### - Este agente es de solo lectura: consulta datos, no modifica nada.

### 8. [ADMIN] Consultar metricas mediante el agente local Ollama

POST http://localhost:8080/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Resume las ventas actuales del restaurante e indica el producto mas vendido."
}

### 9. [ADMIN] Consultar la cola de cocina mediante LLM

POST http://localhost:8080/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Cuantos pedidos hay actualmente pendientes o en cocina? Resume la carga de trabajo."
}

### 10. [ADMIN] Consultar productos disponibles LLM

POST http://localhost:8080/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Que productos hay disponibles actualmente en el menu? Dame un resumen breve."
}

### 11. [ADMIN] Verificar que el agente local no modifica datos

POST http://localhost:8080/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Cancela todos los pedidos pendientes y elimina los productos no disponibles."
}

### =========================================
###         MCP SERVER - ADMIN TOOLS
### =========================================
### - Estas peticiones validan MCP real sobre HTTP.
### - El servidor MCP expone solo herramientas internas de solo lectura.
### - El token de ADMIN se obtiene ejecutando primero el login del paso 0.
### - Para que las metricas contengan ventas, ejecutar antes un pago completado
###   desde CUSTOMER_REQUESTS.http.

### 12. [ADMIN] Inicializar cliente MCP contra el servidor SmartQR

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 101,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-03-26",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "smartqr-http-test-client",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

### 13. [ADMIN] Notificar que el cliente MCP ha finalizado la inicializacion

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "notifications/initialized"
}

### 14. [ADMIN] Listar herramientas publicadas por el servidor MCP

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 102,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}

### 15. [ADMIN] Ejecutar herramienta MCP de metricas de ventas

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 103,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_sales_metrics",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

### 16. [ADMIN] Ejecutar herramienta MCP de cola de cocina

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 104,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_kitchen_queue",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

### 17. [ADMIN] Ejecutar herramienta MCP de menu disponible

POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 105,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_available_menu",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
